{"pages":[{"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["ALL ABOUT THE",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,424.94000000000005,116.00059999999996,80,false],["FALL RETREAT",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,402.22000000000003,176.00059999999996,80,false],["EVERYTHING YOU NEED TO KNOW",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,472.86000000000001,194.10059999999999,20,false],["THE BIG PICTURE",146.40000000000001,227.4606,222.24000000000001,248.00059999999996,20,false],["Conferences serve multiple purposes in the growth of",146.40000000000001,247.07509999999991,349.1160000000001,259.47709999999995,9,false],["a ministry but if you were to narrow down the reasons",146.40000000000001,260.07109999999989,350.25000000000006,272.47309999999993,9,false],["for having a Fall Retreat to just one, it would be this: to",146.40000000000001,273.06709999999998,351.447,285.46909999999997,9,false],["take the many individuals involved in your ministry",146.40000000000001,286.06309999999996,341.97000000000014,298.46509999999995,9,false],["and sew them together into a close community of",146.40000000000001,299.05909999999994,331.92600000000004,311.46109999999993,9,false],["committed believers.",146.40000000000001,312.05509999999992,226.36500000000001,324.45709999999991,9,false],["Think through:",370.20000000000005,233.43489999999986,427.83600000000007,245.8368999999999,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,246.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,258.8368999999999,9,false],["Who is this retreat for?",388.20000000000005,246.43489999999986,475.85100000000006,258.8368999999999,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,259.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,271.8368999999999,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,285.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,297.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,311.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,323.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,337.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,349.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,376.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,388.83689999999996,9,false],["What are the specific objectives I plan to",388.20000000000005,259.43489999999986,541.5870000000001,271.8368999999999,9,false],["accomplish?",388.20000000000005,272.43089999999995,436.01700000000005,284.83289999999994,9,false],["What are the needs I would most like to meet for",388.20000000000005,285.43489999999997,571.22400000000016,297.83689999999996,9,false],["this group?",388.20000000000005,298.43089999999995,430.39200000000005,310.83289999999994,9,false],["How should I arrange my retreat schedule to",388.20000000000005,311.43489999999997,556.32900000000006,323.83689999999996,9,false],["meet this objective?",388.20000000000005,324.43089999999995,463.95299999999997,336.83289999999994,9,false],["How many participants are realistically expected",388.20000000000005,337.43489999999997,574.38300000000015,349.83689999999996,9,false],["to attend this retreat? What would be your faith",388.20000000000005,350.43089999999995,569.67600000000016,362.83289999999994,9,false],["goal?",388.20000000000005,363.42689999999993,407.77500000000003,375.82889999999992,9,false],["What measurable results do I want to see after",388.20000000000005,376.43489999999997,563.82600000000014,388.83689999999996,9,false],["this retreat?",388.20000000000005,389.43089999999995,434.77499999999998,401.83289999999994,9,false],["In light of this objective the Fall Retreat is designed",146.40000000000001,338.0560999999999,340.76400000000001,350.45809999999989,9,false],["to help students grow in their relationship with Christ",146.39999999999998,351.05209999999988,351.447,363.45409999999987,9,false],["and grow in their relationship with one another. You",146.39999999999998,364.04809999999986,343.86900000000003,376.45009999999985,9,false],["want good Bible teaching and lots of time for personal",146.39999999999998,377.04409999999984,349.42200000000003,389.44609999999983,9,false],["reflection and devotions, and you want lots of time",146.39999999999998,390.04009999999982,336.87600000000009,402.44209999999981,9,false],["to socialize, hang-out, and have fun. You leave for",146.39999999999998,403.03609999999981,331.72799999999995,415.43809999999979,9,false],["the Fall Retreat a collection of individuals and you",146.39999999999998,416.03209999999979,336.33600000000001,428.43409999999977,9,false],["come back to campus—Lord willing— a united body",146.39999999999998,429.02809999999977,341.03400000000005,441.43009999999975,9,false],["of believers. The Fall Retreat consolidates all of the",146.39999999999998,442.02409999999975,339.65700000000004,454.42609999999974,9,false],["ministry growth of the first 6-7 weeks on campus.",146.39999999999998,455.02009999999973,333.18600000000004,467.42209999999972,9,false],["A L L A B O U T T H E FA L L R E T R E AT 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,640.66729999999995,9,false],["To put on a Fall Retreat isn’t brain surgery but it does",146.39999999999998,481.02109999999971,347.06400000000002,493.42309999999969,9,false],["require some time, labor, and effort. To that end it’s",146.39999999999998,494.01709999999969,338.82900000000006,506.41909999999967,9,false],["not a bad idea to combine efforts with another campus",146.39999999999998,507.01309999999967,351.63600000000008,519.41509999999971,9,false],["ministry—share the labor and responsibility. If you",146.39999999999998,520.00909999999965,338.77500000000003,532.41109999999958,9,false],["are a student led ministry, there’s no reason not to",146.39999999999998,533.00509999999963,334.70700000000011,545.40709999999967,9,false],["join in with an existing Fall Retreat that’s taking place",146.39999999999998,546.00109999999972,350.03400000000005,558.40309999999965,9,false],["near you. If it’s already been prepared and planned,",146.39999999999998,558.99709999999959,338.75700000000006,571.39909999999963,9,false],["why not take advantage of it?",146.39999999999998,571.99309999999969,255.99299999999999,584.39509999999973,9,false],["If, however, you need to put on your own Fall Retreat,",146.39999999999998,597.99409999999966,347.05500000000006,610.39609999999971,9,false],["what follows are some helpful guidelines and",146.39999999999998,610.99009999999976,316.62600000000009,623.39209999999969,9,false],["suggestions. As you read through the content, realize",146.39999999999998,623.98609999999962,345.53399999999999,636.38809999999967,9,false],["that depending on the size of your ministry and",146.39999999999998,636.98209999999972,324.74400000000014,649.38409999999976,9,false],["leadership, you can run a successful retreat at much",146.39999999999998,649.9780999999997,342.39300000000003,662.38009999999974,9,false],["lower level of structure and organization.",146.39999999999998,662.97409999999968,302.30700000000002,675.37609999999972,9,false],["GOALS AND OBJECTIVES",146.40000000000001,695.46010000000001,254.78,716.00009999999997,20,false],["CONTRACTING YOUR RETREAT",370.20000000000005,421.81989999999996,503.08000000000004,442.35989999999998,20,false],["SELECTING A DATE",370.20000000000005,451.91489999999999,431.88000000000005,467.31989999999996,15,false],["Look for potential circumstances that might",370.20000000000005,467.43489999999997,537.89700000000016,479.83689999999996,9,false],["impact both attendance at the event and contract",370.20000000000005,480.43089999999995,556.07700000000023,492.83289999999994,9,false],["negotiations with the property. Such as:",370.20000000000005,493.42689999999993,521.98500000000013,505.82889999999992,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,506.43490000000003,374.34000000000003,518.83690000000001,9,false],["Academic\/campus calendar",388.20000000000005,506.43490000000003,494.29200000000009,518.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,519.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,531.83690000000001,9,false],["Weather",388.20000000000005,519.43489999999997,421.31100000000004,531.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,532.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,544.83690000000001,9,false],["Community events",388.20000000000005,532.43489999999997,460.82100000000003,544.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,545.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,557.83690000000001,9,false],["Local church events",388.20000000000005,545.43489999999997,464.58300000000008,557.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,558.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,570.83690000000001,9,false],["Consideration of flexible dates (to take advantage",388.20000000000005,558.43489999999997,575.11200000000008,570.83690000000001,9,false],["of retreat site off-season)",388.20000000000005,571.43090000000007,483.69900000000007,583.8329,9,false],["BOOKING THE FACILITY",370.20000000000005,594.91489999999999,446.50500000000011,610.31989999999996,15,false],["Call your desired facility as early as a year in advance.",370.20000000000005,610.43489999999997,572.47500000000014,622.83690000000001,9,false],["You may have to resort to your second or third",370.20000000000005,623.43090000000007,544.01700000000005,635.8329,9,false],["location choice if you wait too long to reserve space.",370.20000000000005,636.42689999999993,565.82400000000007,648.82889999999998,9,false],["The best practice would be to try to book a site right",370.20000000000005,649.42290000000003,565.51800000000026,661.82490000000007,9,false],["after the current year’s retreat is over (a year out).",370.20000000000005,662.41890000000001,558.42600000000016,674.82090000000005,9,false],["While booking a site find out when you are expected",370.20000000000005,675.41489999999999,566.34600000000012,687.81690000000003,9,false],["to sign a contract, make a deposit, give a head count,",370.20000000000005,688.41089999999997,566.33700000000022,700.81290000000001,9,false],["cancel (if applicable), etc. Put these dates on a",370.20000000000005,701.40689999999995,545.14200000000017,713.80889999999999,9,false],["calendar you will frequently look at so that you can",370.20000000000005,714.40290000000005,561.93600000000015,726.80489999999998,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"ocr":false},{"h":792,"ocr":false,"segs":[["A L L A B O U T T H E FA L L R E T R E AT 2",43.841199999999994,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,641.45920000000001,9,false],["stay on top of the deadlines.",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,251.09700000000004,45.836899999999901,9,false],["Everything is negotiable prior to signing the contract.",146.40000000000001,59.435899999999833,348.77400000000017,71.837899999999877,9,false],["Things to consider:",146.40000000000001,72.431899999999814,219.54300000000001,84.833899999999858,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,97.836899999999901,9,false],["Food and Bev",164.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,215.44800000000001,97.836899999999901,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,98.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,110.8368999999999,9,false],["AV and equipment charges",164.40000000000001,98.434899999999857,266.10899999999998,110.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,123.8368999999999,9,false],["Meeting room charges",164.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,249.61200000000002,123.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,136.8368999999999,9,false],["Deposit",164.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,194.226,136.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,149.8368999999999,9,false],["Deadlines for final counts",164.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,261.834,149.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,162.8368999999999,9,false],["Multi-year contracts for better rate",164.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,298.18499999999995,162.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,175.8368999999999,9,false],["Other miscellaneous charges (internet, delivery,",164.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,346.83899999999994,175.8368999999999,9,false],["parking,etc)",164.40000000000001,176.43089999999984,210.66900000000001,188.83289999999988,9,false],["Contracts over $10,000 must be approved by Tom",146.40000000000001,202.43189999999981,333.79800000000006,214.83389999999986,9,false],["Doster (Tom.Doster@ccci.org). Use a Contract",146.40000000000001,215.42789999999979,325.50000000000011,227.82989999999984,9,false],["Routing Slip from the FSG website.",146.40000000000001,228.42389999999978,280.44600000000003,240.82589999999982,9,false],["Insurance",146.40000000000001,254.09189999999978,189.834,267.47489999999982,9,false],["Make sure to ask your facility if insurance is needed.",146.40000000000001,267.42089999999973,344.31000000000006,279.82289999999978,9,false],["If proof of insurance is required for your group call",146.40000000000001,280.41689999999983,337.8300000000001,292.81889999999981,9,false],["Debbie Townsend with the General Counsel Office at",146.40000000000001,293.41289999999981,346.71300000000008,305.8148999999998,9,false],["888-272-4411.",146.40000000000001,306.40889999999979,201.66000000000003,318.81089999999978,9,false],["Equipment",146.40000000000001,332.1019,194.25300000000001,345.48489999999998,9,false],["Find out what type of equipment the facility has",146.40000000000001,345.43089999999995,327.84900000000005,357.83289999999994,9,false],["available for you. Think through what equipment you",146.40000000000001,358.42689999999993,349.10700000000008,370.82889999999992,9,false],["might want before you call. Such as:",146.40000000000001,371.42289999999991,281.28300000000002,383.8248999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,396.83689999999996,9,false],["video projection units",164.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,247.947,396.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,409.83689999999996,9,false],["sound and video equipment",164.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,269.24099999999999,409.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,410.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,422.83689999999996,9,false],["staging",164.40000000000001,410.43489999999997,192.048,422.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,423.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,435.83689999999996,9,false],["video screen",164.40000000000001,423.43489999999997,212.23500000000001,435.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,448.83689999999996,9,false],["extension cords",164.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,224.57400000000001,448.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,461.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,462.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,474.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,487.83689999999996,9,false],["power strips",164.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,212.11799999999999,461.83689999999996,9,false],["overhead projectors",164.40000000000001,462.43489999999997,240.55799999999999,474.83689999999996,9,false],["sports equipment, etc.",164.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,248.75700000000001,487.83689999999996,9,false],["PROGRAMMING YOUR RETREAT",146.40000000000001,507.81990000000002,285.25999999999999,528.35990000000004,20,false],["By starting with your goals and objectives you can",146.40000000000001,527.43489999999997,334.82400000000007,539.83690000000001,9,false],["balance your retreat to meet the needs of your",146.40000000000001,540.43090000000007,319.72200000000009,552.8329,9,false],["attendees. Be cautious of over or under scheduling.",146.40000000000001,553.42689999999993,341.70900000000006,565.82889999999998,9,false],["Think through past retreats and the elements in the",146.40000000000001,579.42790000000002,341.81700000000012,591.82989999999995,9,false],["schedule that worked and what didn’t. Communicate",146.40000000000001,592.4239,346.65899999999999,604.82590000000005,9,false],["to your speaker, emcee and band the objectives of the",146.40000000000001,605.4199000000001,346.63200000000006,617.82190000000003,9,false],["retreat. Check in with them periodically to confirm",146.40000000000001,618.41589999999997,340.9620000000001,630.81790000000001,9,false],["that they are on the same page.",146.40000000000001,631.41190000000006,262.45500000000004,643.8139000000001,9,false],["One consideration in mapping the schedule is to make",146.40000000000001,657.41290000000004,351.10500000000002,669.81490000000008,9,false],["note of meal times. Some facilities have set meal",146.40000000000001,670.40890000000002,330.70200000000011,682.81090000000006,9,false],["times.",146.40000000000001,683.4049,169.78199999999998,695.80690000000004,9,false],["SAMPLE SCHEDULE",370.20000000000005,35.595100000000002,435.06000000000006,51.000099999999975,15,false],["Friday",370.20000000000005,51.11509999999987,395.38200000000006,63.517099999999914,9,false],["7:00 - Arrive",370.20000000000005,64.11509999999987,466.87800000000004,76.517099999999914,9,false],["7:00 – 8:00 Settle into rooms",370.20000000000005,77.11509999999987,507.63000000000005,89.517099999999914,9,false],["8:00-10:00 1st session (Praise & Worship)",370.20000000000005,90.11509999999987,558.25500000000011,102.51709999999991,9,false],["10:00 Games or structured activity?",370.20000000000005,103.11509999999987,555.54600000000005,115.51709999999991,9,false],["Saturday",370.20000000000005,129.11509999999987,404.85000000000002,141.51709999999991,9,false],["8:30 Breakfast",370.20000000000005,142.11509999999987,479.09100000000007,154.51709999999991,9,false],["9:00 - 10:00 Personal Devotional Time",370.20000000000005,155.11509999999987,541.37099999999998,167.51709999999991,9,false],["10:00- 11:30 2nd Session (Praise & Worship)",370.20000000000005,168.11509999999987,563.28600000000006,180.51709999999991,9,false],["12:00 – 1:00 Lunch",370.20000000000005,181.11509999999987,466.90500000000003,193.51709999999991,9,false],["1:00